  "description": "CIBFAY crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C61 H104 Gd12 Na6 O90,9(H2 O1),0.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd9 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd10 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd11 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd12 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.997-4.028 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.38-115.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd12Na6(OAc)25(HCO2)5(CO3)6(H2O)12]·9H2O·0.5MeCN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 25 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
